n      if (typeof requireUnlocked === 'function' && !requireUnlocked()) return;\\n      (Array.isArray(roadmapData) ? roadmapData : []).forEach(t => { if (t) delete t._jiraChange; });\\n      (Array.isArray(archivedTasks) ? archivedTasks : []).forEach(t => { if (t) delete t._jiraChange; });\\n      try { if (typeof persistProjectState === 'function') persistProjectState(); } catch (e) {}\\n      if (typeof renderRoadmap === 'function') renderRoadmap();\\n      renderJiraChangesChip();\\n      closeJiraChangesModal();\\n      if (typeof showToast === 'function') showToast('Отметки изменений сняты', 'ok', 2500);\\n    }\\n    function jiraNormBase(u) {\\n      let s = String(u || '').trim().replace(/\\\\s+/g, '');\\n      if (!s) return '';\\n      const localBare = /^(?:localhost|127\\\\.0\\\\.0\\\\.1|\\\\[::1\\\\])(?::\\\\d+)?(?:[/?#]|$)/i.test(s);\\n      if (!/^[a-z][a-z0-9+.\\\\-]*:\\\\/\\\\//i.test(s)) {\\n        const isHostWithPort = /^[^/?#]+:\\\\d+(?:[/?#]|$)/.test(s);\\n        if (/^[a-z][a-z0-9+.\\\\-]*:/i.test(s) && !localBare && !isHostWithPort) return '';\\n        s = (localBare ? 'http://' : 'https://') + s;\\n      }\\n      let url;\\n      try { url = new URL(s); } catch (e) { return ''; }\\n      if (url.username || url.password) return '';\\n      const host = String(url.hostname || '').toLowerCase();\\n      const isLoopback = host === 'localhost' || host === '127.0.0.1' || host === '::1' || host === '[::1]';\\n      if (url.protocol !== 'https:' && !(url.protocol === 'http:' && isLoopback)) return '';\\n      url.search = '';\\n      url.hash = '';\\n      const path = String(url.pathname || '').replace(/\\\\/+$/, '');\\n      return url.origin + (path === '/' ? '' : path);\\n    }\\n    function jiraOrigin(base) {\\n      const normalized = jiraNormBase(base);\\n      if (!normalized) return '';\\n      try { return new URL(normalized).origin; } catch (e) { return ''; }\\n    }\\n    function jiraIsCloud(base) {\\n      try { return /(?:^|\\\\.)atlassian\\\\.net$/i.test(new URL(jiraNormBase(base)).hostname); } catch (e) { return false; }\\n    }\\n    function jiraGetEl(id) { return document.getElementById(id); }\\n    function jiraReadForm() {\\n      const base = jiraNormBase(jiraGetEl('jiraBaseUrl').value);\\n      const proj = (jiraGetEl('jiraProjectKey').value || '').trim().toUpperCase();\\n      const jql = (jiraGetEl('jiraJql').value || '').trim();\\n      const scopeEl = jiraGetEl('jiraImportScope');\\n      const scope = scopeEl && scopeEl.value === 'keys' ? 'keys' : 'projects';\\n      return { base, proj, jql, scope };\\n    }\\n    // Несколько проектов: «WEB, APP» -> ['WEB','APP']\\n    function jiraParseProjects(raw) { return String(raw || '').toUpperCase().split(/[\\\\s,;]+/).map(x => x.trim()).filter(Boolean); }\\n    const JIRA_KEYS_PER_QUERY = 200;\\n    function jiraExtractKeys(value) {\\n      const matches = String(value || '').toUpperCase().match(/\\\\b[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*-\\\\d+\\\\b/g) || [];\\n      return matches;\\n    }\\n    // Все Jira-ключи, которые пользователь видит в активном плане: обычные задачи,\\n    // вехи и контейнеры Initiative/Epic/Story. Архив намеренно не включаем: он не является Гантом.\\n    function jiraPlanKeys() {\\n      const found = new Set();\\n      const add = (value) => jiraExtractKeys(value).forEach(key => found.add(key));\\n      (Array.isArray(roadmapData) ? roadmapData : []).forEach(task => { if (task) add(task.jira || ''); });\\n      if (sectionMeta && typeof sectionMeta === 'object' && !Array.isArray(sectionMeta)) {\\n        Object.keys(sectionMeta).forEach(section => { const meta = sectionMeta[section]; add(meta && meta.key); });\\n      }\\n      (Array.isArray(planSections) ? planSections : []).forEach(add);\\n      return [...found].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b, 'ru', { numeric: true, sensitivity: 'base' }));\\n    }\\n    function jiraProjectClause(projRaw) {\\n      const ps = jiraParseProjects(projRaw);\\n      return ps.length === 0 ? '' : (ps.length === 1 ? `project = ${ps[0]}` : `project in (${ps.join(', ')})`);\\n    }\\n    function jiraKeysClause(keys) {\\n      const list = Array.isArray(keys) ? keys : [];\\n      return list.length ? `key in (${list.join(', ')})` : '';\\n    }\\n    function jiraDefaultJql(projRaw) {\\n      const clause = jiraProjectClause(projRaw);\\n      if (!clause) return '';\\n      return `${clause} ORDER BY Rank ASC`;\\n    }\\n    function jiraDefaultKeysJql(keys) {\\n      const clause = jiraKeysClause(Array.isArray(keys) ? keys : jiraPlanKeys());\\n      return clause ? `${clause} ORDER BY Rank ASC` : '';\\n    }\\n    // Это еще авто-шаблон «только проект(ы)»? Тогда JQL можно безопасно пересобрать при смене проектов.\\n    // Важно: ловим и `project = KEY`, и `project in (...)` (прежняя проверка на `=\\\\b` не срабатывала для одного проекта).\\n    function jiraIsAutoJql(jql) {\\n      return /^\\\\s*(?:project\\\\s*(?:=\\\\s*[^\\\\s()]+|in\\\\s*\\\\([^)]*\\\\))|(?:key|issuekey)\\\\s*(?:=\\\\s*[^\\\\s()]+|in\\\\s*\\\\([^)]*\\\\)))\\\\s*ORDER\\\\s+BY\\\\s+Rank\\\\s+ASC\\\\s*$/i.test(String(jql || '').trim());\\n    }\\n    // Меняет только область выборки (project/key), оставляя пользовательские фильтры и ORDER BY.\\n    function jiraReplaceScopeClause(jql, clause) {\\n      const cur = String(jql || '').trim();\\n      if (!cur) return clause ? `${clause} ORDER BY Rank ASC` : '';\\n      if (!clause) return cur;\\n      const scopeRe = /\\\\b(?:project\\\\s*(?:=\\\\s*[^\\\\s()]+|in\\\\s*\\\\([^)]*\\\\))|(?:key|issuekey)\\\\s*(?:=\\\\s*[^\\\\s()]+|in\\\\s*\\\\([^)]*\\\\)))/i;\\n      if (scopeRe.test(cur)) return cur.replace(scopeRe, clause).replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\\n      const oi = cur.search(/ORDER BY/i);\\n      const head = oi >= 0 ? cur.slice(0, oi).trim() : cur;\\n      const tail = oi >= 0 ? cur.slice(oi).trim() : '';\\n      return (clause + (head ? ' AND ' + head : '') + (tail ? ' ' + tail : '')).replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\\n    }\\n    // Заменяет (или добавляет) условие по проекту в JQL текущими ключами из поля «Проекты», сохраняя остальные фильтры.\\n    function jiraReplaceProjectClause(jql, projRaw) {\\n      return jiraReplaceScopeClause(jql, jiraProjectClause(projRaw));\\n    }\\n    function jiraRenderImportScope() {\\n      const scopeEl = jiraGetEl('jiraImportScope');\\n      const scope = scopeEl && scopeEl.value === 'keys' ? 'keys' : 'projects';\\n      const keys = jiraPlanKeys();\\n      ['projects', 'keys'].forEach(value => {\\n        const btn = jiraGetEl('jiraScope-' + value); if (!btn) return;\\n        const active = value === scope;\\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-checked', active ? 'true' : 'false');\\n        btn.setAttribute('data-active', active ? '1' : '0');\\n        btn.classList.toggle('bg-white', active);\\n        btn.classList.toggle('shadow-sm', active);\\n        btn.classList.toggle('text-indigo-700', active);\\n        btn.classList.toggle('text-slate-500', !active);\\n      });\\n      const projectInput = jiraGetEl('jiraProjectKey');\\n      if (projectInput) { projectInput.disabled = scope === 'keys'; projectInput.classList.toggle('opacity-50', scope === 'keys'); projectInput.classList.toggle('cursor-not-allowed', scope === 'keys'); }\\n      const projectLabel = jiraGetEl('jiraProjectLabel');\\n      if (projectLabel) projectLabel.textContent = scope === 'keys' ? 'Проекты (не используются)' : 'Проекты';\\n      const info = jiraGetEl('jiraKeysScopeInfo');\\n      if (info) info.classList.toggle('hidden', scope !== 'keys');\\n      const count = jiraGetEl('jiraPlanKeysCount');\\n      if (count) count.textContent = keys.length + ' ' + pluralRu(keys.length, ['ключ', 'ключа', 'ключей']);\\n      const batches = jiraGetEl('jiraPlanKeysBatches');\\n      if (batches) {\\n        const n = Math.ceil(keys.length / JIRA_KEYS_PER_QUERY);\\n        batches.textContent = !keys.length ? 'В плане пока нет Jira-ключей.' : (keys.length > JIRA_KEYS_PER_QUERY ? 'Jira откр